      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 18 Hermitage Drive is a beautifully maintained three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached home in an established residential development in Cobh, Co. Cork.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property offers bright, spacious accommodation suited to first-time buyers and families. It has three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a main bedroom with an en suite.\r\n\r\nThe home benefits from gas central heating, with a new Bosch heating installation and 1,050 mm fixed horizontal flue fitted in February 2026. It also has double-glazed windows and a C BER rating.\r\n\r\nA private driveway provides off-street parking, while the garden offers space to enjoy outdoors. A bus stop is located at the entrance to the estate, and a local shop, pub and crèche are close by.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms and three bathrooms, including a main bedroom en suite\r\nBosch gas heating installation with 1,050 mm fixed horizontal flue, fitted February 2026\r\nDouble-glazed windows\r\nBER: C \r\nBER No. 119885382\r\nPrivate driveway and garden\r\nBus stop at the estate entrance\r\nLocal shop, pub and crèche nearby\r\n103m2\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €340,000"
      },
